                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-dotnet/releases/tag/Google.Cloud.Dlp.V2-4.21.0"&gt;Google.Cloud.Dlp.V2 version 4.21.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
