                                &lt;h3&gt;New features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspect and deid templates in RedactImage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Store DlpJob findings in a Cloud Storage bucket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publish DlpJob findings to Dataplex Universal Catalog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Storage discovery filters based on tag filters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
